{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Hg3FoCK0PU1792990650.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，天水圍新晉屋苑YOHO West備受市場追捧，連錄租賃成交，包括1期3A座高層A10室，實用面積437 平方呎，兩房間隔，向北，放盤1周即租出，月租1.6萬元，呎租36.6元。</p><p><br/>伍耀祖表示，業主於2023 年12月以522.49萬元一手買入單位，是次租金回報達3.7厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:42:59.977763+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.329742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:24.833687+00:00","content_hash":"571c996044a4e2a7050910bc91e944aa6b297133e4ee26a99b83a8836f604c81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:42:59.977763+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}